Re-cut on main: c1bd717 (8 Oct) conflicted in chat.service.ts's imports
and was never shipped. Same change, placed after the greeting answer as
on the branch.

MASTER TEST RUN AD-015, 2 of 2: a search the owner accepted recorded no
outcome, so „successful searches" stayed 0. The model is asked to call
record_search_outcome and rarely does.

The server now reads the plain cases itself. A short owner line (80 chars
or less) saying the result was what she needed („ეს მჭირდებოდა", „ზუსტად
ეს", "that's exactly what I needed", "perfect"…, ka/en/ru/es) records
`accepted` on her newest search that found someone in the last 30 minutes.
„Not what I needed" records `refused`. An outcome already set is never
overwritten (onlyIfUnset). The reply never waits on it, and a bare
„მადლობა" is no verdict. No new words reach the model or the owner.

DONE WHEN: AD-015 — the successful count rises by one after the acceptance line.

